{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-02974-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["휴원 기간은 1주일이다","부득이하게 어린이집 보육이 필요한 아이를 둔 부모들에 대해서는 원아를 등원할 수 있도록 했지만"],"reason":"It keeps the overall framing and the closure order. It leaves out emergency childcare and the figures, and it omits the one-week closure period and the exception for dual-income and single-parent families. The sentence '맡길 곳이 마땅치 않아서다' is left hanging, and the last sentence says little about the content of the posts."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["4일 고양시청에 따르면 지난 3일 고양시 전체 어린이집 등원 아동(2만5804명) 가운데 5954명(23%)","휴원 기간은 1주일이다"],"reason":"It preserves the closure order, the childcare difficulty and the emergency childcare statistics accurately. It omits the one-week closure period and the full-time-mother (전업맘) side. The connective '아이를 맡길 곳이 마땅치 않아서다' is awkward."},"C":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["맞벌이나 한부모 가정 등 부득이하게 어린이집 보육이 필요한 아이를 둔 부모들에 대해서는 원아를 등원할 수 있도록 했지만","휴원 기간은 1주일이다"],"reason":"'직장맘·전업주부·보육 대란이 이어지고 있다' is an awkward list that treats 보육 대란 as a parallel item. The statistics are correct, but the one-week period is missing. The summary also does not say that the 5954 children were in Goyang or that emergency childcare was an available service."},"D":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["지난 3일 지역 내 모든 어린이집에 휴원 명령","맞벌이 가정 '직장맘'"],"reason":"The '휴원 명령을 내렸지만, ... 글이 올라왔다' link is a loose contrast that implies the wrong relation. The summary leaves out why the working mothers were struggling, namely that they had nowhere to leave their children. It includes the statistics but not the one-week period."}}}
